message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript and this repository."
title: "jtm-preeclampsia-code: placental cis-eQTL Mendelian randomisation, colocalisation and single-cell analysis of preeclampsia"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Qiu
    given-names: Xiaowei
    affiliation: "Department of Obstetrics and Gynecology, Nanfang Hospital, Southern Medical University, Guangzhou, China"
    email: qxw24657@163.com
year: 2026
license: MIT
keywords:
  - preeclampsia
  - Mendelian randomisation
  - colocalisation
  - placental eQTL
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - scDRS
  - MAGMA
repository-code: "https://github.com/qxw-AS/jtm-preeclampsia-code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a study integrating placental cis-eQTL Mendelian randomisation,
  Bayesian colocalisation and placental single-cell profiling in preeclampsia.
  The pipeline covers instrument construction from SuSiE credible sets, allele
  harmonisation against two preeclampsia GWAS, Wald/IVW estimation, random-effects
  meta-analysis with an overlap correction, colocalisation grading, MAGMA gene and
  gene-set analysis, scDRS compartment scoring, and an MR-PheWAS across FinnGen R12
  endpoints.
